ngs of the 35th SICE Annual Conference International Session Papers: July 24&#x02013;26 1996; Tottori, Japan</source><year>1996</year><fpage>1205</fpage><lpage>1208</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="book"><source>MobIR&#x000ae; M4 Thermal Camera User Manual</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>China: Wuhan Guide Infrared Technology Co., Ltd. Wuhan</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B35"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sung</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Facial feature extraction in an infrared image by proxy with a visible face image</article-title><source>IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement</source><year>2007</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>2057</fpage><lpage>2066</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>